  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Access to Profitable and Inclusive Agriculture Markets for Smallholder</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to support access to profitable and inclusive agriculture markets for economic empowerment and livelihood resilience of smallholder farmers, especially women and youth in Kasungu district.</narrative>
  </description>
